  "limitations": [
    "The stepped workshop outline matches the large footprint beside the information point and approach. The gate faces the visitor approach, toward the northwest. The precise opening positions, pavilion height and rear openings are reconstructed from photographs.",
    "The retained Terrarium rises across the workshop. Stepped building volumes and buried foundation skirts follow that terrain. The entrance slab is anchored near the sampled front path. The exterior heights are approximate.",
    "The asset represents the park’s full-size entrance, workshop and connected waterside café frontage. The terrace edge follows the mapped water bank. Its paving width, measured terrain fit and the smaller window details approximate the photographed complex. Other visitor buildings and miniature exhibits are separate components."
  ]
